      "label": "s2_sub_008_doku_07",
      "hash64": "20C01BEA316F2966",
      "text": "Es kommt nur selten vor, von der noblen Rioba\\neine solch überwältigende Aura zu spüren.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_aku_07",
      "hash64": "4368C959C8651F96",
      "text": "Otis will einfach nur nicht, dass du ihn in einer\\nso uncoolen Situation siehst.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_kakutou_10",
      "hash64": "0C96315883EAC863",
      "text": "Hey, Leute... Wo ist eigentlich Irsita?[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_doku_08",
      "hash64": "20C026EA316F3C17",
      "text": "Die werte Irsa hat vor einigen Stunden jählings\\ndas Zimmer verlassen, um Dehnübungen\\r\\nnachzugehen, wie sie es nannte.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_fairy_09",
      "hash64": "BB42A63E873D781E",
      "text": "Die faulenzt garantiert einfach nur. Wir reden hier\\nschließlich von Irsa.[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_kakutou_11",
      "hash64": "0C96305883EAC6B0",
      "text": "Wir sollten keine voreiligen Anschuldigungen\\nmachen, aber...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_aku_08",
      "hash64": "4368D459C8653247",
      "text": "Tut mir leid, aber würdest du vielleicht Irsa für\\nuns aufspüren, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?\\c\\nSie ist bestimmt irgendwo in der Akademie.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_aku_09",
      "hash64": "4368D359C8653094",
      "text": "In der Zwischenzeit sorgen wir hier für ein\\noptimales Lernumfeld, den richtigen Vibe\\r\\nsozusagen.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_kakutou_12",
      "hash64": "0C96335883EACBC9",
      "text": "Du würdest uns echt einen großen Gefallen tun,\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Bitte suche Irsita![VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_aku_10",
      "hash64": "43654659C8620B26",
      "text": "Konzentrationsfördernde Hintergrundmusik,\\nhmmm...\\c\\nAlso dann schon mal nicht Ettas Songs, würde ich\\nsagen.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_kakutou_13",
      "hash64": "0C96325883EACA16",
      "text": "Irsita wollte sich nach der ständigen Lernerei\\nbestimmt nur mal die Beine vertreten.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_fairy_10",
      "hash64": "BB3F193E873A52B0",
      "text": "Wenn sie dich für Nachhilfe angeschleppt haben,\\nbist du wohl auch noch gut in der Schule, was?\\c\\nGibt’s auch was, das du nicht kannst?\\nDas regt mich voll auf![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_doku_09",
      "hash64": "20C025EA316F3A64",
      "text": "Ich bitte Euch um Geleit aus dem Labyrinth der\\nUnwissenheit.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
